        "freeText": "Boss was tough but fair. Two jams, both with one or two cells left and only leftover scraps of paint (blue 2, yellow 1, red 2) filling both waiting slots. The third try won in 17 moves by relaunching waiting buckets before taking the big red, so the last slot stayed free. I did not use +1 slot: I wanted a clean solve. The return preview was useful, especially the red warning."
